00:13:52,941 --> 00:13:58,941
18-year-old Noah moves from America to London, with her mother who's recently
fallen in love with William, a wealthy British businessman.

3
00:20:49,411 --> 00:20:55,411
Noah meets William’s son, bad-boy Nick, and soon discovers there
is an attraction between them neither can avoid.

4
00:27:45,882 --> 00:27:51,882
As Noah spends the summer adjusting to her new life, her devastating past will
catch up with her while falling in love for the first time.

